>> hex := Ifomathi entsha: ['%x'].

# write 10
Imveliso bhala: Hx xA, umgca-omtsha.

# make it easy to write numbers as hex
Inani xa-kufika: ['as-hex'] yenza: { <- hex sebenzisa-kwinani-elipheleleyo: ngokwakho.
}.

# write
Imveliso bhala: Hx xA as-hex, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: Hx xFF as-hex, umgca-omtsha.